  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Admin. Municipio Drenaje Urbano R. Janeiro(Guan)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Munic. Adm. Urban Drainage R. Janeiro (Guan)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS LOAN WILL FINANCE URBAN DRAINAGE AND DIGITAL MAPPING FOR THE MUNICIPALITY OF RIO DE JANEIRO. THESE ACTIVITIES WERE TO HAVE BEEN FINANCED AS PART OF THE GUANABARA BAY LOAN APPROVED IN LATE 1993. HOWEVER, FEASIBILITY WORK FOR THESE COMPONENTS HAD NOT BEEN COMPLETED AND IT WAS AGREED THAT A SEPARATE PRJOJECT FOR THESE ACTIVITIES WOULD BE PRESENTED IN 1994. (SEE PAGE 12 OF LOAN PROPOSAL). THESE ACTIVITIES ARE INCLUDED IN THE ORIGINAL PROFILE II.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
